From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 13:32:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [upstream] [rust icc] Accept ICC profiles with zeroed version
 field
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Merge to release branch 7922 for M151.

Some AVIF files contain ICC profiles with all-zero version bytes. The
old skcms path accepted these profiles because it only rejects ICC major
versions greater than 4, but the Rust ICC path rejected them through
moxcms.

Patch moxcms to treat exactly 0x00000000 as V2_0 for compatibility with
skcms.

(cherry picked from commit 8a20d7503435306f8749beb10a9a4f5ac83aacee)

(cherry picked from commit 4e206547bff07382a3ef18d9a9212c5aa615c528)

